<text x="557" y="73" text-anchor="middle" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="11" fill="#ff6b6b">OPTIONS rewrite</text>
<text x="20" y="106" font-family="Inter, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#ff6b6b">two rewrites + fsyncs, each proportional to the total collection count</text>
<line x1="20" y1="124" x2="660" y2="124" stroke="#29322f"/>
